<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo Nobel earnings by business segment.</title>
<headline>Akzo Nobel earnings by business segment.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter 1996</p>
<p>Operating profit by business segment (millions of guilders)</p>
<p>    Chemicals					124  vs  145</p>
<p>    Coatings					 201  vs  146</p>
<p>    Pharmaceuticals				190  vs  188</p>
<p>    Fibres					     2  vs   28</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous			 charge   7  vs   13 charge</p>
<p>    Total					    510  vs   494</p>
<p>Third-quarter sales by business segment</p>
<p>(billions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Chemicals				     1.80  vs  1.70</p>
<p>    Coatings					1.95  vs  1.74</p>
<p>    Pharmaceuticals			     0.96  vs  0.93</p>
<p>    Fibres					  0.79  vs  0.86</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous debit (millions)	     8  vs     9</p>
<p>    Total					   5.49  vs   5.22</p>
<p>First nine months 1996</p>
<p>Operating profit by business segment (millions of guilders)</p>
<p>    Chemicals					448  vs  503</p>
<p>    Coatings					 475  vs  417</p>
<p>    Pharmaceuticals				573  vs  563</p>
<p>    Fibres					    62  vs  125</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous			 charge   9  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Total (billions)			    1.55  vs  1.61</p>
<p>Nine-months sales by business segment</p>
<p>(billions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Chemicals				     5.65  vs  5.44</p>
<p>    Coatings					5.61  vs  5.23</p>
<p>    Pharmaceuticals			     2.92  vs  2.84</p>
<p>    Fibres					  2.59  vs  2.73</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous debit (millions)	    24  vs    33</p>
<p>    Total					  16.75  vs  16.21</p>
</text>
